title: Compute semantic_hash for packages
status: complete
atomic: true
priority: medium
blocked_by: []
created_at: '2026-06-15T05:51:53'
updated_at: '2026-06-15T12:04:53'
result: 'Added `blake3` crate. Implemented `compute_semantic_hash(name, scope, version,
  source_bytes, dep_hashes) -> [u8;32]` in src/pkgid.rs using Blake3 with a domain-separated
  key "jinn:pkgid:semantic_hash:v1". Hashes: name, scope path, version, source byte
  length + content, dep count + sorted dep hashes. Added 8 tests covering: determinism,
  name/source/version/scope/dep changes all flip the hash, dep order matters, empty
  source is stable and non-zero. All 15 pkgid tests pass; 285 lib tests pass.'
description: Implement the semantic_hash field computation for PackageId, defining
  what inputs contribute to the hash (source content, version, dependency identities).
  Done when packages produce stable, deterministic semantic hashes verified by tests,
  including that identical content yields identical hashes and changed content yields
  different hashes. Depends on PackageId data structure subtask.
